<DocsLayout title="Events" description="Subscribe to lifecycle events in axios-retryer for monitoring, logging, and custom workflows.">

<h1 class="page-title">Events</h1>
<p class="page-lead">The event system lets you react to every stage of the retry lifecycle. Use it for logging, dashboards, analytics, and custom side effects — without touching request code.</p>

<h2>Subscribing to events</h2>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode0} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Unsubscribing</h2>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode1} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Plugin-specific events</h2>
<p>Plugin events become available after calling <code>use()</code>. The returned value has the widened event type:</p>

<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode2} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Event reference</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Payload</th><th>Plugin required</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>onRetryProcessStarted</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Retry cycle begins for a request</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>beforeRetry</code></td><td><code>AxiosRequestConfig</code></td><td>—</td><td>Before each individual retry attempt</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>afterRetry</code></td><td><code>config, success: boolean</code></td><td>—</td><td>After each individual retry attempt</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onFailure</code></td><td><code>AxiosError</code></td><td>—</td><td>A single attempt failed</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onRetryProcessFinished</code></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>All retry attempts complete (success or terminal failure)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onRequestCancelled</code></td><td><code>requestId: string</code></td><td>—</td><td>A request was cancelled</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onInternetConnectionError</code></td><td><code>AxiosError</code></td><td>—</td><td>Network-level error (no response)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onMetricsUpdated</code></td><td><code>RetryMetrics</code></td><td>MetricsPlugin</td><td>Metrics snapshot after each request cycle</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onTokenRefreshed</code></td><td><code>token: string</code></td><td>TokenRefreshPlugin</td><td>Token refreshed successfully</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onBlockingRequestFailed</code></td><td><code>config</code></td><td>RequestDependencyPlugin</td><td>A CRITICAL/blocking request failed</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onAllBlockingRequestsResolved</code></td><td>—</td><td>RequestDependencyPlugin</td><td>All blocking requests completed</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>onManualRetryProcessStarted</code></td><td>—</td><td>ManualRetryPlugin</td><td>Manual replay begins</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

